WEBVTT

00:31.120 --> 00:32.320
Host

00:32.320 --> 00:34.320
the ceremony?

00:35.960 --> 00:36.750
Sure.

00:37.640 --> 00:38.960
But don't expect me

00:39.880 --> 00:42.240
to pay for it.

00:43.430 --> 00:45.840
The Ji family will handle all costs.

00:46.840 --> 00:48.750
Not just the catering.

00:49.240 --> 00:50.920
I'm her father,

00:51.320 --> 00:52.240
arriving empty-handed

00:52.670 --> 00:55.960
would be humiliating.

00:57.240 --> 00:58.600
The Ji name carries weight.

01:00.150 --> 01:03.150
Ordinary gold

01:03.150 --> 01:04.640
and silk?

01:05.950 --> 01:08.480
Beneath you.

01:09.590 --> 01:10.310
So perhaps

01:10.789 --> 01:11.480
you'd cover

01:11.480 --> 01:13.950
my gift as well?

01:31.070 --> 01:32.640
[Right then, I understood.]

01:33.560 --> 01:34.870
[Every love that ever truly existed]

01:35.229 --> 01:36.400
[was a gift of fortune.]

01:37.200 --> 01:38.120
[Parent and child.]

01:38.400 --> 01:39.280
[Husband and wife.]

01:39.479 --> 01:40.150
[None of them any different.]

01:41.039 --> 01:41.870
[When it's there, it's there.]

01:42.430 --> 01:43.120
[When it isn't...]

01:43.400 --> 01:44.400
[no force on earth can conjure it.]

02:00.510 --> 02:01.280
Grandmother's already

02:01.430 --> 02:02.510
sorted your gift.

02:03.280 --> 02:04.480
It's sitting in the storehouse.

02:05.480 --> 02:06.480
Give us your word,

02:07.310 --> 02:07.790
and

02:08.280 --> 02:09.590
it's yours tomorrow.

02:23.800 --> 02:24.840
To think this slip of a girl

02:25.120 --> 02:25.590
could shadow

02:25.590 --> 02:26.750
my love's entire fate.

02:26.910 --> 02:27.710
Bind her.

02:27.870 --> 02:28.680
Send her away.

02:28.840 --> 02:29.190
Yes, my lord.

02:38.680 --> 02:39.590
[I will never beg]

02:39.590 --> 02:40.520
[to be loved again.]

02:41.360 --> 02:42.710
[I'll only tend to the hearts]

02:43.190 --> 02:44.430
[that have already chosen me.]

03:47.470 --> 03:48.960
What's done is done.

03:49.680 --> 03:51.030
You've had your say.

03:52.190 --> 03:53.680
But the ceremony

03:53.680 --> 03:54.710
will go forward.

03:55.079 --> 03:57.079
And your father will be invited.

03:57.520 --> 03:58.470
Why hold

03:58.560 --> 04:00.120
a ceremony at all?

04:00.910 --> 04:03.150
Every woman comes of age.

04:03.680 --> 04:05.190
There's nothing remarkable about that.

04:07.240 --> 04:08.840
What kind of nonsense is that?

04:10.430 --> 04:11.710
I know it stings,

04:12.150 --> 04:13.750
watching us

04:13.750 --> 04:15.030
go to your father hat in hand.

04:15.750 --> 04:16.870
But hear me:

04:17.160 --> 04:18.510
none of that matters.

04:19.070 --> 04:21.750
What matters is this ceremony.

04:22.270 --> 04:23.870
The defining rite

04:24.560 --> 04:26.240
of a woman's life.

04:26.870 --> 04:29.040
Your first true entrance into the world.

04:30.120 --> 04:31.040
And it determines

04:31.040 --> 04:32.750
the match you'll make.

04:33.310 --> 04:34.870
Without it,

04:35.430 --> 04:37.070
how will anyone ever see

04:37.480 --> 04:39.159
the woman you've become?

04:40.600 --> 04:41.720
What exactly is so amusing?

04:42.800 --> 04:43.430
Grandmother,

04:43.750 --> 04:45.240
rest easy.

04:45.240 --> 04:46.800
The concern isn't that

04:47.000 --> 04:48.000
no one knows her.

04:48.040 --> 04:49.000
It's that far too many already do.

04:50.190 --> 04:52.040
You're asking for it!

04:52.630 --> 04:53.270
Very well.

04:53.600 --> 04:54.240
Honestly?

04:54.950 --> 04:56.680
I'd never feel right

04:56.830 --> 04:58.270
handing her to strangers.

04:58.870 --> 05:00.390
You two are so close already,

05:00.800 --> 05:01.560
why not

05:01.630 --> 05:02.830
keep things simple?

05:03.360 --> 05:05.070
Spare us all those

05:05.390 --> 05:06.800
hollow formalities.

05:10.120 --> 05:10.800
No, no,

05:11.070 --> 05:11.720
Grandmother, please...

05:11.920 --> 05:13.070
That ceremony

05:13.270 --> 05:14.190
is happening.

05:14.310 --> 05:15.190
I was being ridiculous.

05:15.360 --> 05:16.680
I get it now.

05:16.680 --> 05:17.800
Quite right, Grandmother!

05:18.190 --> 05:19.240
A girl like her

05:19.360 --> 05:20.630
deserves nothing less

05:20.750 --> 05:21.870
than the grandest ceremony

05:21.870 --> 05:23.240
imaginable!

05:23.560 --> 05:24.430
Let every village...

05:25.830 --> 05:26.240
no,

05:27.000 --> 05:28.560
let the whole realm

05:28.800 --> 05:31.040
witness her extraordinary grace

05:31.160 --> 05:32.040
and beauty!

05:32.190 --> 05:33.000
Enough.

05:33.240 --> 05:33.800
I know precisely

05:33.800 --> 05:35.159
what you're after.

05:35.310 --> 05:36.040
Now out,

05:36.430 --> 05:37.560
we have matters

05:37.560 --> 05:38.600
to attend to.

05:46.920 --> 05:48.310
Where did you dig those words up?

05:55.120 --> 05:55.870
Hey,

05:56.720 --> 05:57.630
that was uncalled for!

05:57.870 --> 05:59.310
You mocked me first!

06:00.310 --> 06:01.070
So

06:01.070 --> 06:02.360
you did notice.

06:02.600 --> 06:03.310
And I haven't even touched on

06:03.310 --> 06:04.560
your little bonfire yet.

06:04.870 --> 06:06.070
Aren't you the insensitive one!

06:06.750 --> 06:07.750
Every last coin,

06:07.870 --> 06:08.950
I'll earn it back!

06:11.070 --> 06:12.600
I'm not asking you for a single coin.

06:13.430 --> 06:14.430
I'm saying,

06:15.120 --> 06:15.950
at least do it

06:15.950 --> 06:17.160
for Grandmother.

06:17.680 --> 06:19.120
Can you just show some grace?

06:19.240 --> 06:20.310
What would grace accomplish?

06:20.830 --> 06:22.160
If the ceremony falls apart,

06:22.360 --> 06:23.950
my name suffers a little, nothing new.

06:24.600 --> 06:25.600
Grandmother will never bring herself

06:25.600 --> 06:26.560
to give me away to anyone.

06:27.830 --> 06:28.750
And in any case...

06:29.600 --> 06:30.040
I still have you,

06:30.040 --> 06:31.720
my dear cousin, don't I?

06:33.159 --> 06:34.310
Don't flatter yourself.

06:34.750 --> 06:35.270
Hey...

06:35.870 --> 06:36.390
Jinzhao!

07:00.430 --> 07:01.510
Who is...

07:03.070 --> 07:04.480
Greet Lord Chen, now!

07:05.800 --> 07:06.600
My greetings, Lord Chen!

07:15.510 --> 07:16.240
Please, rise.

07:18.870 --> 07:19.750
This is your cousin?

07:20.480 --> 07:21.000
Yes.

07:22.000 --> 07:23.800
She's a bit of a free spirit,

07:24.070 --> 07:25.000
doesn't get out much,

07:25.480 --> 07:26.800
had no idea you'd be here.

07:27.190 --> 07:28.270
My apologies

07:28.430 --> 07:29.680
if she's caused any offense.

07:32.159 --> 07:32.720
Not at all.

07:33.870 --> 07:34.720
You must have come

07:34.720 --> 07:36.159
to see my grandmother.

07:36.920 --> 07:38.040
I wouldn't impose,

07:38.390 --> 07:39.680
we shall withdraw.

08:11.750 --> 08:13.310
Alright, enough!

08:13.750 --> 08:15.190
There's no fire. Walk.

08:15.190 --> 08:16.190
Quiet!

08:16.830 --> 08:17.870
Keep your distance

08:18.430 --> 08:19.800
from him.

08:20.630 --> 08:21.240
He pushed

08:21.240 --> 08:22.680
a sweeping tax reform,

08:22.830 --> 08:24.390
persuaded His Majesty to dispatch

08:24.390 --> 08:25.630
royal auditors to noble estates.

08:26.430 --> 08:27.830
Now half the court hates him.

08:27.830 --> 08:29.120
Prince Glorian especially.

08:29.360 --> 08:30.190
Now he's "taken ill"

08:30.430 --> 08:31.560
and taken refuge here.

08:32.120 --> 08:32.960
Surely he's the very man

08:32.960 --> 08:34.270
Grandmother's often spoken of,

08:34.270 --> 08:35.150
Lord Chen?

08:35.750 --> 08:36.840
She said his reform

08:37.000 --> 08:39.080
would wipe out half their wealth!

08:39.630 --> 08:40.600
You have no idea

08:40.789 --> 08:42.390
how bad it's gotten.

08:42.750 --> 08:44.030
The whole court is a mess.

08:44.870 --> 08:46.000
Those guys

08:46.120 --> 08:47.510
are in the Emperor's ear

08:47.510 --> 08:48.630
every other day.

08:49.240 --> 08:50.270
And as for Lord Chen?

08:50.390 --> 08:51.080
They would

08:51.080 --> 08:52.480
see him destroyed.

08:54.120 --> 08:54.870
You know,

08:55.480 --> 08:57.030
cut their purse, cut their throat.

08:57.910 --> 08:58.480
These are

08:58.480 --> 08:59.600
merciless men.

08:59.720 --> 09:01.320
Assassination is within their reach.

09:02.150 --> 09:03.120
I must see to

09:03.120 --> 09:04.080
more guards at once.

09:05.000 --> 09:06.200
Not a soul in her own family...

09:06.200 --> 09:06.790
Yeah.

09:06.870 --> 09:07.720
Deigned to

09:07.720 --> 09:08.360
hold a ceremony.

09:08.360 --> 09:08.750
Quite.

09:08.840 --> 09:10.270
So she installs herself here,

09:10.390 --> 09:11.670
and lets the Jis bear it...

09:13.550 --> 09:14.480
-My lady...
-My lady...

09:15.120 --> 09:15.750
Go...

09:26.750 --> 09:27.360
My lady,

09:28.870 --> 09:29.840
dusk is falling.

09:30.000 --> 09:31.120
Where are you off to?

09:32.910 --> 09:33.870
The back hill.

09:37.360 --> 09:38.320
Do not follow.

09:52.080 --> 09:53.600
What a perverse world.

09:54.390 --> 09:55.030
I had barely

09:55.030 --> 09:56.480
drawn first breath,

09:56.790 --> 09:58.030
when my father cast me out,

09:58.030 --> 09:59.080
a blemish upon his ambitions.

09:59.750 --> 10:01.630
The moment I found my way home,

10:02.150 --> 10:03.840
he barred the door against me.

10:05.080 --> 10:06.030
Tell me,

10:07.550 --> 10:08.960
was I wrong

10:09.790 --> 10:10.440
to act?

10:17.000 --> 10:19.030
The gift is burned. So be it.

10:20.600 --> 10:21.600
What truly galls me

10:22.390 --> 10:23.840
is that the ceremony must proceed.

10:24.750 --> 10:25.720
And that man

10:26.270 --> 10:27.390
must still be invited.

10:31.510 --> 10:32.550
I should have

10:32.870 --> 10:33.960
found another way...

11:33.390 --> 11:34.480
I've taken the trouble

11:35.600 --> 11:36.840
to draft a petition,

11:36.840 --> 11:38.870
calling for the full repeal

11:39.960 --> 11:40.720
of

11:41.790 --> 11:43.670
your tax reform.

11:45.080 --> 11:46.550
You need only add your seal

11:47.390 --> 11:48.080
and things

11:49.120 --> 11:50.080
will end here.

12:03.840 --> 12:04.840
And

12:05.750 --> 12:07.120
should I refuse?

12:11.270 --> 12:12.840
Then I shall

12:16.390 --> 12:18.030
end you here.

12:20.440 --> 12:21.320
Then

12:22.150 --> 12:23.390
so be it.

12:36.270 --> 12:37.390
Chen Yanyun...

12:38.390 --> 12:39.630
a secret army...

12:39.630 --> 12:40.840
How dare you!

12:42.240 --> 12:43.240
This is treason!

12:43.550 --> 12:45.320
You're insane!

13:00.240 --> 13:01.120
Chen Yanyun...

13:01.670 --> 13:02.600
Kill me...

13:03.030 --> 13:04.030
and you'll follow me to the grave!

13:06.510 --> 13:07.390
Is that so?

13:10.870 --> 13:11.510
Chen Yanyun...

13:12.000 --> 13:12.790
Spare my life.

13:13.120 --> 13:14.030
And the nobles

13:14.150 --> 13:15.270
will be on your side!

13:16.870 --> 13:17.840
Spare me and

13:18.240 --> 13:19.080
every man of influence

13:19.080 --> 13:20.080
will back your reform.

13:25.440 --> 13:26.840
What is that...

13:28.000 --> 13:29.510
Did I fall asleep?

15:07.750 --> 15:08.440
Jinzhao,

15:09.270 --> 15:10.080
you OK?

15:10.720 --> 15:11.240
Are you in

15:11.240 --> 15:12.200
any pain?

15:13.390 --> 15:14.360
Yao...

15:15.510 --> 15:17.080
you pulled me out?

15:17.870 --> 15:18.600
Wasn't me.

15:19.000 --> 15:19.960
Xuanqing did.

15:52.240 --> 15:53.360
Madam's here.

15:54.960 --> 15:55.720
I must go greet her.

15:56.510 --> 15:57.320
Do not leave her side.

16:07.120 --> 16:07.630
Grandmother.

16:09.030 --> 16:09.790
Madam.

16:10.030 --> 16:11.510
Greetings, Master Chen.

16:12.030 --> 16:13.080
I'm told it was you

16:13.080 --> 16:14.910
who brought her back.

16:15.360 --> 16:17.200
We are deeply

16:17.550 --> 16:20.030
in your debt.

16:20.720 --> 16:21.750
Pray, think nothing of it.

16:22.630 --> 16:23.200
Please,

16:23.320 --> 16:23.840
attend to

16:23.840 --> 16:24.960
Ms. Gu now.

16:25.480 --> 16:26.120
I shall

16:26.600 --> 16:27.480
take my leave,

16:28.030 --> 16:28.670
ma'am.

16:37.960 --> 16:39.270
How does she fare?

16:40.510 --> 16:42.000
Awake. The healer's seen her.

16:42.030 --> 16:42.790
Nothing grave.

16:43.550 --> 16:44.720
And the back hill...

16:45.080 --> 16:46.720
has it been properly attended to?

16:47.030 --> 16:47.910
Taken care of.

16:50.750 --> 16:51.960
Yet something

16:52.200 --> 16:53.360
weighs upon me.

16:53.840 --> 16:54.750
Once she had been

16:55.150 --> 16:56.320
pulled from the water,

16:56.550 --> 16:58.030
he arranged for word to reach me.

16:58.630 --> 16:59.910
But in such a downpour,

17:00.240 --> 17:01.720
a man who leaps into the water

17:01.840 --> 17:02.870
or even lingers at its edge

17:03.270 --> 17:04.640
does not emerge dry.

17:05.589 --> 17:07.790
When I came upon Xuanqing,

17:08.030 --> 17:09.920
there was not a trace of water on him.

17:10.440 --> 17:11.640
Grandmother,

17:11.880 --> 17:12.960
I don't think he's the one

17:13.200 --> 17:14.069
who saved her.

17:15.720 --> 17:16.349
Grandmother,

17:17.589 --> 17:18.589
if it was Lord Chen

17:18.880 --> 17:20.109
who pulled her out...

17:20.510 --> 17:21.880
is it possible she witnessed...

17:22.510 --> 17:24.510
Should Lord Chen have saved her,

17:24.750 --> 17:26.550
whatever she may have seen...

17:26.640 --> 17:28.200
it need not trouble us.

17:28.480 --> 17:30.070
I shall speak with her,

17:30.240 --> 17:32.160
then sound out Lord Chen.

17:33.270 --> 17:34.160
But this

17:34.590 --> 17:35.830
stays quiet.

17:36.480 --> 17:38.240
Even if she asks,

17:38.590 --> 17:41.550
the answer is Chen Xuanqing.

17:43.270 --> 17:43.830
Understood.

17:52.110 --> 17:52.960
Uncle.

18:07.000 --> 18:07.640
And?

18:09.200 --> 18:09.790
Did they

18:11.310 --> 18:12.350
buy your story?

18:13.350 --> 18:14.830
When Ms. Gu woke up,

18:15.160 --> 18:16.680
I didn't speak with her at all.

18:17.240 --> 18:18.480
Mrs. Ji seemed to read

18:18.590 --> 18:20.200
what you intended.

18:20.510 --> 18:21.680
She let the matter lie.

18:24.480 --> 18:25.030
Yeah.

18:25.550 --> 18:26.310
I have

18:26.550 --> 18:27.160
two jars of

18:27.160 --> 18:28.550
royal warming wine here.

18:29.000 --> 18:29.680
Tomorrow,

18:30.030 --> 18:31.590
send them to Ms. Gu.

18:32.000 --> 18:32.510
And remember,

18:32.960 --> 18:34.030
you saved her.

18:34.270 --> 18:35.240
The wine's from you.

18:37.550 --> 18:38.070
Understood.

18:38.830 --> 18:40.310
Apply yourself to the exams.

18:41.350 --> 18:41.830
You may go.

18:49.640 --> 18:52.160
Kneel in honor of the parents.

18:57.720 --> 18:59.400
We don't need that part.

18:59.880 --> 19:01.350
Cut it.

19:04.920 --> 19:06.310
Go and rest.

19:06.680 --> 19:07.640
The rest of you too.

19:07.640 --> 19:08.310
Yes, madam.

19:12.920 --> 19:14.000
My dear child,

19:14.440 --> 19:15.640
what is it now?

19:15.640 --> 19:16.750
You were getting on so well.

19:17.480 --> 19:18.880
I'm not kneeling to Gu Dezhao.

19:20.880 --> 19:22.270
The rites are

19:22.400 --> 19:23.720
the rites, child.

19:25.000 --> 19:25.590
I find myself weary.

19:26.350 --> 19:26.750
But...

19:28.310 --> 19:28.720
It...

19:38.000 --> 19:38.680
Qingpu,

19:38.880 --> 19:40.240
that inkstone

19:40.240 --> 19:41.310
I received a few days back,

19:41.310 --> 19:42.070
go grab it for me.

19:42.480 --> 19:44.440
I wish to present it to Master Chen.

19:45.000 --> 19:45.880
Yes, my lady.

19:53.720 --> 19:54.310
Master Chen.

19:54.440 --> 19:55.030
Ms. Gu.

19:57.070 --> 19:58.590
I was on my way to see you.

19:59.750 --> 20:00.240
Yunting.

20:02.880 --> 20:03.960
After last night's misfortune,

20:04.000 --> 20:05.070
one must guard against the cold.

20:05.440 --> 20:06.550
This is an imperially bestowed

20:06.550 --> 20:07.350
warming wine,

20:07.640 --> 20:08.880
a measure or two

20:09.030 --> 20:10.110
ought to offer some relief.

20:11.030 --> 20:12.000
You are most considerate.

20:12.160 --> 20:12.790
My sincere thanks.

20:13.480 --> 20:14.440
And how perfectly timed,

20:14.640 --> 20:16.030
you arrive bearing wine,

20:16.270 --> 20:18.350
and I have a token of gratitude too.

20:19.030 --> 20:19.680
Qingpu.

20:22.030 --> 20:23.880
A Nightslate inkstone,

20:24.000 --> 20:25.110
and a box of Umbral Ink.

20:25.550 --> 20:26.790
The ink is ordinary enough,

20:27.110 --> 20:28.270
but the inkstone

20:28.310 --> 20:29.590
is an antique.

20:30.720 --> 20:32.750
I find its plainness rather endearing.

20:33.000 --> 20:34.680
It belongs now with you.

20:35.550 --> 20:36.920
A scholar like you

20:37.110 --> 20:38.030
ought to have it.

20:40.110 --> 20:42.070
I accept with gratitude,

20:44.070 --> 20:44.880
Ms. Gu.

20:54.000 --> 20:54.590
Actually,

20:55.160 --> 20:57.110
when you came to my aid,

20:57.270 --> 20:58.750
were you alone upon the hill?

20:59.720 --> 21:00.240
I was.

21:01.160 --> 21:03.160
May I ask what brought you there?

21:03.510 --> 21:05.000
I arrived here but yesterday.

21:05.310 --> 21:07.000
With certain matters weighing on me,

21:07.310 --> 21:08.400
so I went for a walk.

21:09.160 --> 21:10.270
I happened to pass the hill

21:10.830 --> 21:12.270
and saw you in the water.

21:12.510 --> 21:13.510
I see.

21:15.030 --> 21:16.830
I have other pressing matters.

21:17.070 --> 21:17.920
I shall not

21:18.510 --> 21:19.750
impose further.

21:20.030 --> 21:20.550
Take care.

21:27.590 --> 21:29.000
Did you notice?

21:29.510 --> 21:31.590
He couldn't quite look at me.

21:33.350 --> 21:35.790
Maybe it's just... manners?

21:37.830 --> 21:39.310
His words did not

21:39.550 --> 21:40.590
ring true to me.

21:41.240 --> 21:42.440
I can still dimly recall

21:42.590 --> 21:44.160
the figure I glimpsed

21:44.270 --> 21:45.680
before the water took me...

21:46.510 --> 21:48.270
I don't believe it resembled him.

22:00.200 --> 22:01.110
[Lord Chen...]

22:05.160 --> 22:06.110
[That silhouette...]

22:06.750 --> 22:08.240
[Feels like I've seen it somewhere.]

22:11.270 --> 22:12.480
[Could it truly have been him?]

22:56.310 --> 22:57.720
My lady...

23:14.680 --> 23:15.550
What is it you are looking at?

23:17.830 --> 23:18.680
A bird,

23:19.440 --> 23:22.070
my lord.

23:23.110 --> 23:24.590
I thought you might have remembered.

23:25.830 --> 23:26.400
Remembered... what?

23:27.480 --> 23:28.110
The lantern.

23:39.070 --> 23:39.960
So that was you!

23:41.640 --> 23:42.440
Apologies.

23:43.310 --> 23:43.880
Think nothing of it.

23:46.200 --> 23:46.640
My lord,

23:48.920 --> 23:49.590
all is ready.

23:49.790 --> 23:50.440
We may set out at your word.

24:00.640 --> 24:01.920
[He just meant the lantern.]

24:03.440 --> 24:04.790
[I was imagining things.]

24:09.030 --> 24:10.030
My lord.

24:10.310 --> 24:11.200
A total of

24:11.510 --> 24:13.960
114 crates of classified files

24:14.310 --> 24:16.550
have been salvaged from the water

24:16.750 --> 24:18.000
and secured here.

24:18.350 --> 24:20.640
Mute servants keep vigil here.

24:21.160 --> 24:22.160
You can rest easy.

24:22.550 --> 24:25.440
No one else knows this place exists.

24:25.440 --> 24:25.960
Very well.

24:27.960 --> 24:28.920
My lord...

24:29.790 --> 24:30.790
I have...

24:31.480 --> 24:33.110
a favor to ask...

24:34.000 --> 24:35.110
Last night...

24:35.550 --> 24:37.240
Jinzhao had too much wine.

24:37.240 --> 24:39.550
She stumbled in by accident.

24:40.960 --> 24:42.310
I pressed her on the matter...

24:42.830 --> 24:44.350
She saw nothing...

24:45.070 --> 24:46.070
That girl has never

24:46.070 --> 24:47.880
had a scheming bone in her body.

24:48.480 --> 24:49.720
I ask you to

24:50.000 --> 24:51.720
extend your forgiveness,

24:52.480 --> 24:53.880
for my sake.

24:54.510 --> 24:55.790
Not a scheming bone, huh?

24:59.350 --> 25:01.030
I hear there's

25:01.030 --> 25:02.310
quite a ceremony being planned for her.

25:02.790 --> 25:03.480
Indeed.

25:03.790 --> 25:04.830
It's only a few days

25:05.070 --> 25:06.400
from now.

25:07.160 --> 25:08.030
We'd be very honored

25:08.640 --> 25:10.240
if you could come,

25:10.400 --> 25:11.400
my lord.

25:12.160 --> 25:13.030
It goes without saying.

25:14.440 --> 25:15.000
Actually...

25:15.480 --> 25:16.880
I'll write to my mother,

25:17.270 --> 25:19.350
ask her to come as a guest.

25:19.590 --> 25:20.240
How's that sound?

25:21.030 --> 25:22.240
Oh, truly,

25:22.400 --> 25:24.310
a grace beyond measure...

25:24.310 --> 25:25.200
After the ceremony,

25:25.790 --> 25:27.310
send her to the capital.

25:36.510 --> 25:37.270
As you wish.

25:38.640 --> 25:39.590
I shall

25:40.270 --> 25:41.750
take my leave.

27:31.000 --> 27:31.590
Lord Chen!

27:35.510 --> 27:36.160
Mr. Jiang!

27:37.920 --> 27:39.070
I can see from your face

27:39.400 --> 27:40.640
that our pledge of loyalty

27:41.480 --> 27:42.270
has found its mark.

27:43.310 --> 27:44.000
It has.

27:46.720 --> 27:48.640
From the prime minister himself.

28:00.480 --> 28:02.790
He's giving me the Crown Seneschal.

28:06.830 --> 28:08.640
Our deepest congratulations!

28:08.830 --> 28:11.480
The Cabinet is within reach.

28:11.920 --> 28:13.440
Enough. Rise.

28:16.920 --> 28:18.070
That said,

28:18.510 --> 28:19.160
this one played out

28:19.270 --> 28:20.350
just like you called it.

28:20.680 --> 28:21.550
The PM has had

28:21.920 --> 28:22.550
his eye on

28:22.550 --> 28:23.920
Prince Glorian for a long time.

28:25.400 --> 28:26.880
That wasn't me calling anything.

28:27.400 --> 28:28.110
It was...

28:31.310 --> 28:32.070
Right.

28:33.350 --> 28:34.030
Material like this

28:34.030 --> 28:35.590
on every major figure

28:36.240 --> 28:38.070
means the reform

28:39.110 --> 28:40.310
is as good as done.

28:40.750 --> 28:41.830
We can come back to that.

28:42.960 --> 28:44.310
According to the letter,

28:44.510 --> 28:46.110
the appointment may come any day now.

28:46.350 --> 28:47.030
It may

28:47.350 --> 28:48.070
well coincide with

28:48.070 --> 28:49.310
Ms. Gu's ceremony.

28:49.830 --> 28:50.680
All the

28:51.110 --> 28:52.550
local bigwigs will be there.

28:53.310 --> 28:54.880
We would do well

28:55.270 --> 28:56.350
to raise the land reform.

28:56.720 --> 28:57.720
Test the waters.

29:06.030 --> 29:06.640
Easy there.

29:06.790 --> 29:07.110
Yes.

29:08.880 --> 29:09.830
Pick up the pace.

29:10.070 --> 29:11.200
Hear me, all of you!

29:11.680 --> 29:12.960
Guests are beginning to arrive.

29:13.550 --> 29:14.590
Sharp eyes and ready hands.

29:14.960 --> 29:15.400
Understood.

29:17.480 --> 29:19.310
Word has it Ms. Gu's ceremony

29:19.550 --> 29:20.240
is no ordinary affair.

29:20.750 --> 29:22.350
Nothing like the rites

29:22.350 --> 29:23.400
- one usually sees.
- Congratulations!

29:23.790 --> 29:24.350
- Congratulations!
- Welcome!

29:24.400 --> 29:25.000
Is that so?

29:25.440 --> 29:27.270
Word is, the capital's finest are in town.

29:27.720 --> 29:29.070
Men and women together,

29:29.240 --> 29:29.830
all bets are off.

29:29.830 --> 29:30.270
Greetings!

29:30.270 --> 29:30.720
Congratulations!

29:30.720 --> 29:31.480
Gentlemen, please!

29:31.480 --> 29:33.200
Women have run the Ji family for ages.

29:33.310 --> 29:33.790
Congratulations!

29:33.790 --> 29:35.790
And Mrs. Ji? A force of nature.

29:36.000 --> 29:37.510
Nothing to raise an eyebrow at.

29:44.790 --> 29:45.270
Uncle!

29:47.680 --> 29:48.680
They say these lotus cakes

29:48.880 --> 29:49.750
are the finest in town.

29:50.160 --> 29:50.880
I bought some.

29:51.070 --> 29:51.790
Do try one.

30:01.960 --> 30:02.830
Meh.

30:04.920 --> 30:05.590
"Meh?"

30:07.640 --> 30:08.960
Fine, what about the plum drops?

30:15.960 --> 30:16.440
Consider this,

30:16.750 --> 30:17.790
she's not of Ji blood,

30:17.790 --> 30:19.160
just the daughter's child.

30:19.400 --> 30:21.030
Yet the family puts on

30:21.030 --> 30:22.110
all this for her?

30:22.510 --> 30:23.350
Some people are

30:23.350 --> 30:24.880
just born under a lucky star.

30:25.310 --> 30:26.350
Lucky for days,

30:26.400 --> 30:27.480
and a temper to match!

30:27.680 --> 30:28.200
A few days ago,

30:28.200 --> 30:29.720
she struck the Chang boy.

30:30.350 --> 30:31.880
His father demanded a proper account

30:32.310 --> 30:33.110
and Ms. Gu declared,

30:33.110 --> 30:34.550
without a trace of remorse,

30:34.720 --> 30:35.960
that Master Chang

30:36.270 --> 30:37.440
had struck first.

30:38.030 --> 30:39.070
Absolutely hilarious!

30:40.000 --> 30:40.790
Please, allow me!

30:40.920 --> 30:42.110
Wait a moment,

30:42.590 --> 30:44.160
could this Ms. Gu be my cousin?

30:45.960 --> 30:46.960
Which cousin?

30:48.920 --> 30:50.720
Uncle Dezhao's eldest daughter.

30:51.030 --> 30:52.270
A diviner said

30:52.270 --> 30:53.550
she'd ruin his prospects,

30:54.160 --> 30:55.160
so they handed her off to the Jis

30:55.160 --> 30:56.350
barely after she was born.

30:57.310 --> 30:58.880
I believe her name is...

30:58.880 --> 30:59.510
Jinzhao.

31:00.160 --> 31:00.920
Has to be her.

31:03.830 --> 31:04.200
Uncle,

31:04.720 --> 31:05.270
it's not like

31:05.270 --> 31:06.270
we've got plans.

31:06.550 --> 31:07.510
Why not swing by the Ji estate

31:07.640 --> 31:08.400
and see what this

31:08.400 --> 31:09.270
mystery cousin of mine

31:09.400 --> 31:10.030
actually

31:10.310 --> 31:10.790
looks like?

31:15.070 --> 31:16.480
Sure, go and strike her.

31:17.590 --> 31:18.830
For what cause?

31:19.000 --> 31:19.790
I am a man of honor.

31:22.960 --> 31:24.110
Greetings!

31:29.200 --> 31:31.830
My respects, Mrs. Chen.

31:32.240 --> 31:33.400
Oh, we've been

31:34.030 --> 31:36.480
like sisters for decades!

31:36.640 --> 31:37.680
None of that, please.

31:39.440 --> 31:40.270
Jinzhao,

31:40.270 --> 31:41.750
come and greet Mrs. Chen.

31:41.830 --> 31:42.920
Greetings,

31:43.200 --> 31:43.720
Mrs. Chen.

31:43.720 --> 31:44.550
That must be...

31:45.000 --> 31:45.920
the cousin I have never met.

31:46.270 --> 31:47.510
So this is our Jinzhao!

31:47.790 --> 31:48.480
Yes.

31:48.480 --> 31:50.640
I met you once, when you were

31:51.070 --> 31:52.750
- barely this tall.
- Chen Yanyun?

31:53.350 --> 31:54.160
And now here you are.

31:54.160 --> 31:54.960
It really is him.

31:55.550 --> 31:57.110
Didn't expect to find him sheltered here.

31:57.790 --> 31:59.440
Take the seat of honor!

31:59.440 --> 32:00.160
An imperial edict!

32:00.240 --> 32:01.310
An imperial edict has arrived!

32:03.000 --> 32:04.030
Imperial edict?

32:04.200 --> 32:05.550
Madam, Lord Chen,

32:05.750 --> 32:06.750
an edict has come from the palace.

32:06.960 --> 32:08.720
It's for Lord Chen.

32:13.590 --> 32:15.160
I'm afraid I'll have to ask everyone

32:15.440 --> 32:16.920
to join me.

32:22.110 --> 32:24.960
By imperial decree,

32:25.200 --> 32:28.030
Chen Yanyun, faithful in service

32:28.110 --> 32:29.160
and resolute in duty,

32:29.310 --> 32:30.590
a man of talent and integrity,

32:30.920 --> 32:32.960
is hereby appointed the Crown Seneschal,

32:33.200 --> 32:35.270
with concurrent duties in the Bureau of Coins.

32:35.590 --> 32:37.440
Serve well,

32:37.550 --> 32:38.680
and honor my trust.

32:38.920 --> 32:40.110
So decreed.

32:40.310 --> 32:40.920
Gratitude,

32:41.640 --> 32:43.030
Your Majesty!

32:44.000 --> 32:46.960
Long live the Emperor!

32:53.350 --> 32:54.720
Please rise, my lord.

32:59.240 --> 33:00.640
Congratulations!

33:03.350 --> 33:04.590
He's officially

33:04.590 --> 33:05.790
the Crown Seneschal.

33:06.590 --> 33:07.510
One foot in the door

33:07.510 --> 33:08.510
of real power.

33:09.480 --> 33:10.480
He knows precisely

33:10.830 --> 33:11.880
whose favor is worth cultivating.

33:14.350 --> 33:15.240
A long journey, my lord,

33:15.510 --> 33:16.440
a room's been

33:16.510 --> 33:17.590
set for you.

33:18.240 --> 33:18.830
Right this way.

33:19.030 --> 33:19.920
I'll excuse myself.

33:21.240 --> 33:22.880
Please, my lord.

33:27.030 --> 33:28.790
Congratulations, my lord.

33:31.720 --> 33:32.880
Congratulations, Lord Chen!

33:33.160 --> 33:34.680
Xu Shiqi, at your service!

33:35.030 --> 33:37.350
Silk merchants, generations running.

33:37.790 --> 33:39.590
Should you find a moment,

33:39.750 --> 33:41.270
I'd be most honored

33:41.550 --> 33:42.400
to host you at my table.

33:42.400 --> 33:43.350
How did my ceremony...

33:43.480 --> 33:43.830
Aye.

33:43.830 --> 33:45.030
turn into his victory party?

33:45.750 --> 33:47.310
Your kindness, Mr. Xu,

33:47.510 --> 33:48.550
- I shall look forward to it.
- That cousin of yours...

33:48.720 --> 33:49.920
is quite the character!

33:52.310 --> 33:53.400
Where are you going?

33:54.030 --> 33:55.310
You're not greeting Lord Chen?

34:05.400 --> 34:06.920
[the heir of Lord Changxing...]

34:07.510 --> 34:08.670
[What's he doing here?]

34:13.000 --> 34:14.800
The nerve!

34:16.070 --> 34:18.190
Chen Yanyun gets promoted, fine!

34:18.590 --> 34:19.920
But did he have to steal my thunder?

34:21.070 --> 34:22.440
Maybe he

34:22.440 --> 34:23.190
didn't know

34:23.190 --> 34:24.550
the edict was coming today.

34:27.440 --> 34:28.070
He knew.

34:28.880 --> 34:30.590
He absolutely knew.

34:31.840 --> 34:32.840
I should have seen it

34:33.280 --> 34:34.760
from the start.

34:35.320 --> 34:36.320
Why would someone like him

34:36.590 --> 34:37.230
show up to

34:37.230 --> 34:38.400
my ceremony?

34:39.280 --> 34:41.440
He just needed a stage.

34:41.670 --> 34:42.800
And I handed it to him!

34:49.070 --> 34:49.710
What is it?

34:50.150 --> 34:51.480
Is Gu Dezhao here?

34:54.280 --> 34:55.000
Never mind.

34:55.760 --> 34:57.630
I'll deal with it when it comes.

34:58.000 --> 34:59.230
No, my lady...

34:59.440 --> 35:00.190
It is...

35:02.630 --> 35:03.480
What is it?

35:03.960 --> 35:05.030
Your father...

35:05.030 --> 35:06.400
he did not bring your mother.

35:06.400 --> 35:08.000
He came with a concubine.

35:09.590 --> 35:10.630
Where are they?

35:11.070 --> 35:12.320
With Madam...

35:15.320 --> 35:15.840
That

35:16.030 --> 35:17.230
is the concubine.

35:24.230 --> 35:24.670
Let's go.

35:30.510 --> 35:31.400
I have

35:32.000 --> 35:35.110
come as promised.

35:36.710 --> 35:38.920
The ceremony has concluded.

35:39.800 --> 35:42.440
Her marriage must be considered.

35:42.960 --> 35:44.670
For her own sake,

35:45.190 --> 35:47.480
she should come home with me.

35:48.000 --> 35:50.710
How very convenient.

35:51.760 --> 35:53.000
Was it not you who refused

35:53.000 --> 35:54.360
to hold the ceremony at all?

35:54.760 --> 35:56.070
We had to

35:56.320 --> 35:57.510
pay you

35:57.630 --> 35:59.190
to come today.

35:59.920 --> 36:02.550
And now you want to take her back.

36:04.280 --> 36:06.030
You take me for a fool?

36:06.760 --> 36:07.670
Show him

36:08.030 --> 36:09.590
the gazette.

36:09.590 --> 36:10.280
Yes, ma'am.

36:17.510 --> 36:19.150
Four men in the capital,

36:19.550 --> 36:21.000
reprimanded.

36:21.360 --> 36:22.480
All for neglecting their families.

36:22.480 --> 36:24.710
The censorate is watching.

36:25.510 --> 36:26.800
You're terrified of being

36:27.280 --> 36:29.550
named among them.

36:29.880 --> 36:30.630
So now, suddenly,

36:30.760 --> 36:32.480
you want her back.

36:33.670 --> 36:35.230
Tell me I'm wrong.

36:36.710 --> 36:38.320
This is... preposterous!

36:38.920 --> 36:40.710
Yes, she's been raised here.

36:41.000 --> 36:42.920
But abandoning my own flesh?

36:42.920 --> 36:44.400
That's a very serious accusation!

36:44.630 --> 36:45.190
You absolute...

36:48.550 --> 36:49.400
Enough!

36:50.400 --> 36:51.590
You've already burnt a fortune!

36:51.840 --> 36:52.840
Don't make a scene!

36:57.710 --> 36:58.190
My lady...

36:58.960 --> 36:59.880
I'm not making a scene.

37:00.360 --> 37:01.510
I don't need to.

37:02.440 --> 37:03.880
He wants to bring me home?

37:04.280 --> 37:05.110
Welcome to keep wanting.

37:11.710 --> 37:12.760
It's him...

37:16.670 --> 37:17.230
OK, listen...

37:26.000 --> 37:27.070
Exquisite.

37:27.190 --> 37:27.630
Quite so.

37:27.630 --> 37:28.630
Simply exquisite.

37:29.360 --> 37:30.190
That bamboo...

37:30.710 --> 37:31.320
It's so vivid.

37:31.320 --> 37:32.510
Almost like it's breathing.

37:41.000 --> 37:42.320
Lovely view from out here.

37:42.960 --> 37:43.670
There is... lotus...

37:43.670 --> 37:45.000
Lord Chen is staying here,

37:45.000 --> 37:46.480
they say.

37:46.920 --> 37:48.670
We must present ourselves...

37:52.840 --> 37:54.070
Jinzhao?

37:56.230 --> 37:57.280
You have some nerve.

37:57.590 --> 37:58.710
What was that!

38:05.400 --> 38:07.280
No quarrel from me, it demeans.

38:08.110 --> 38:09.400
You stand before your father;

38:09.840 --> 38:12.440
is this your manner of greeting?

38:13.480 --> 38:15.190
I see so little of you, Father.

38:15.710 --> 38:18.320
I cannot even recall your rank.

38:18.630 --> 38:19.840
What office do you hold now?

38:20.030 --> 38:21.150
Entered the cabinet yet?

38:21.360 --> 38:22.480
Watch how you speak!

38:23.880 --> 38:24.960
Gentlemen, tea!

38:25.070 --> 38:25.760
Right this way...

38:25.760 --> 38:26.840
Ah, yes, right...

38:27.230 --> 38:27.960
Please!

38:29.400 --> 38:30.550
Maybe Father didn't catch that.

38:31.280 --> 38:32.510
Then I shall repeat.

38:33.590 --> 38:34.670
You cast me aside,

38:34.710 --> 38:36.230
afraid I'd curse

38:36.670 --> 38:37.960
your precious career.

38:38.440 --> 38:39.710
Fifteen years have passed.

38:40.150 --> 38:42.550
What office do you hold now?

38:42.800 --> 38:43.880
Entered the cabinet yet?

38:44.550 --> 38:46.360
You... you insolent...

38:50.110 --> 38:51.630
Talk reached me,

38:51.630 --> 38:52.760
of your boundless disgrace.

38:52.760 --> 38:54.550
I called it lies.

38:54.920 --> 38:56.000
Alas,

38:56.000 --> 38:57.480
they ring true!

38:58.070 --> 38:58.920
Grandmother's

38:59.190 --> 39:00.840
coddling

39:00.840 --> 39:02.110
bred your chaos.

39:02.510 --> 39:03.880
Post-ceremony,

39:04.400 --> 39:06.070
you join me in the capital.

39:06.630 --> 39:07.880
Speak no further!

39:07.960 --> 39:09.000
Not happening!

39:09.840 --> 39:11.030
I will do no such thing!

39:11.230 --> 39:11.590
You...

39:12.920 --> 39:13.880
Kneel! Now!

39:15.760 --> 39:16.800
Fine...

39:17.710 --> 39:18.510
I tried...

39:18.760 --> 39:21.000
being reasonable!

39:24.030 --> 39:25.480
Go for it!

39:26.670 --> 39:28.630
Lord Chen, newly elevated

39:29.150 --> 39:30.440
and presently overseeing

39:32.840 --> 39:33.630
the entirety of

39:33.960 --> 39:35.670
the Bureau of Coins,

39:36.110 --> 39:37.280
stands behind you,

39:38.000 --> 39:39.710
observing.

39:39.960 --> 39:41.760
Impress him enough,

39:42.440 --> 39:43.320
and he might

39:43.800 --> 39:45.400
vouch for you.

39:45.880 --> 39:47.110
Your career shall advance, shall it not?

39:48.360 --> 39:49.360
Of all things ungovernable,

39:50.190 --> 39:52.630
women top the list.

39:53.510 --> 39:56.480
Truer words were never written!

40:01.710 --> 40:02.670
My lord...

40:19.000 --> 40:20.320
Tell her,

40:20.590 --> 40:22.150
I stole her thunder.

40:22.510 --> 40:23.670
She just called it even.

40:24.110 --> 40:25.150
We're square.

40:26.320 --> 40:27.030
Gratitude, my lord.

40:30.440 --> 40:31.880
My lord,

40:32.550 --> 40:33.440
Lord Changxing's heir

40:33.670 --> 40:35.280
came with the Gu boy,

40:35.280 --> 40:36.190
purely for leisure's sake.

40:36.480 --> 40:37.320
He came without

40:37.630 --> 40:38.510
making himself known.

40:39.150 --> 40:40.190
Fine, let him be.

40:40.880 --> 40:41.440
Understood.

40:47.510 --> 40:48.070
My lady,

40:48.400 --> 40:49.400
those two

40:49.440 --> 40:50.920
are from the Gus.

40:51.230 --> 40:52.400
Maybe we go around?

40:53.150 --> 40:54.280
I'd avoid anyone else.

40:54.510 --> 40:55.280
The Gus?

40:55.760 --> 40:56.880
Absolutely not.

41:01.590 --> 41:02.800
Quite the boldness,

41:04.030 --> 41:05.440
to pass before me

41:05.440 --> 41:06.320
without a greeting.

41:07.710 --> 41:09.190
I don't even flinch at Lord Chen.

41:09.280 --> 41:10.320
And you think I'd bow for you?

41:13.550 --> 41:14.960
Unbelievable...

41:23.150 --> 41:23.630
Please.

41:28.110 --> 41:29.360
The Jis have mounted

41:29.360 --> 41:30.760
quite the spectacle!

41:30.840 --> 41:32.280
What are they up to?

41:32.590 --> 41:33.480
I know.

41:40.840 --> 41:43.070
Let the ceremony begin!
